# ============================================================
# Sudo_Hatter_Command HOME BASE — .gitignore
# The home base tracks ONLY its own infra (.agents, _artifacts, docs,
# _experiment, _system, lobby .claude/.opencode, root map files,
# youtube_transcripts). Every sub-project keeps its OWN git repo and is
# NEVER tracked here.
# ============================================================

# All projects live under Projects/ and are independent repos.
# (Ignore rules removed to allow VS Code Git repository auto-discovery)

# All projects live under Projects/ and are independent repos. The old root-level pre-migration entries
# (aviationChat-AGY, fresh-workspace-bmad, jetChat-AGY, B&L WorldWide, NEXGen Films, ingestion-Pipeline-*, openCode)
# have been retired now that those workspaces are under Projects/.

# GitNexus code-graph index (disposable Tier-2 accelerator — never committed).
**/.gitnexus/

# Map-drift journal (machine-local commit-time cache written by .githooks/post-commit — a HINT the
# nag + /smh-update-maps-indexes read; check_maps.py's git-diff-vs-anchor stays ground truth). Rebuilt as you commit.
**/docs/.maps-journal*.jsonl

# Build / runtime junk anywhere.
# NO trailing slash on the first three, deliberately (SCC-77): a trailing slash matches DIRECTORIES
# ONLY, and `link-worktree-assets.py` gives every worktree a SYMLINK at these paths rather than a
# real directory. So `**/node_modules/` ignored them in the shared checkout and missed them in every
# worktree — where `task_preflight.py` then counted the link as an uncommitted change and BLOCKED
# the close-out of a lane that was actually clean.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
*.pyc

# Secrets / local
**/.env
# `**/.env` matches ONLY a file named exactly `.env` — not `.env.local`, and not the
# `<name>.pre-restore.bak` copies that Restore-EnvMaster.ps1 / restore-env-master.sh drop beside
# every file they overwrite. On the 2026-08-04 Desktop restore that gap left a live Firebase API
# key sitting in an untracked `frontend/.env.local.pre-restore.bak` inside AGY (fixed in AGY's own
# .gitignore too). Restores land secrets in projects whose ignore rules nobody re-checked, so both
# patterns belong here as the backstop.
**/.env.local
**/*.pre-restore.bak
**/auth_keys/
# Master env bundle for machine migration (built by
# _my_resources/migrations/Export-EnvMaster.ps1) — never committed. Pattern is
# deliberately path-independent: the vault stays ignored wherever it lands.
**/_secrets/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Story worktrees — MACHINE-LOCAL, never committable. A worktree dir holds a
# `.git` FILE, so a blanket `git add` records it as a gitlink (mode 160000) with
# no .gitmodules; pulling that on another machine creates empty dirs at exactly
# the paths `git worktree add` needs. Push the BRANCH, not the tree.
# (Bit AGY in d098dc63 — pre-empting it here.)
.claude/worktrees/


# macOS Finder droppings — machine noise, never content
**/.DS_Store
